Hi Avery,

Quarter-end is two weeks away. Here's what's new in Ramp to make the close faster.

Close checklist
A guided view of everything outstanding: unmatched receipts, uncoded transactions, pending approvals, and open reimbursements, sorted by owner. Send one reminder to everyone at once.

Receipt matching
Ramp now matches receipts from Gmail, Lyft, Uber, Amazon Business, and 50 more merchants automatically. Employees only get asked when we couldn't find one.

Accounting sync
QuickBooks and NetSuite syncs run every 15 minutes, and rejected entries show the reason inline so you can fix and resync in place.

Also new: recurring vendor spend alerts (we'll flag a SaaS renewal before it charges) and a Slack digest for approvers.

